cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use tWRM8 in your research, please cite this software."
title: "tWRM8: temporal Worldvolume Reconstruction and Morphometry"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Francis"
    given-names: "Christopher Michael"
    affiliation: "University of South Alabama"
repository-code: "https://github.com/franccm/tWRM8"
url: "https://github.com/franccm/tWRM8"
version: "1.0.0"
license: "MIT"
abstract: >-
  tWRM8 is a computational platform for reconstruction, quantitative morphometry,
  and fingerprint analysis of dynamic biological events represented as
  spatiotemporal hypervolumes.
keywords:
  - biological imaging
  - spatiotemporal analysis
  - hypervolume
  - morphometry
  - dynamic ROI
  - fluorescence imaging
  - microscopy
